Debug.show_element_updates=Show element updates
Debug.show_element_updates_desc=Highlight elements whose Paint lifecycle actually ran this frame and show cached-view reuse status. Page switches can be classified as local updates, cache reuse, or full-page repaint directly on the window.
Debug.visual_legend=Layout: orange=margin · blue=border · green=padding · purple=content · red=clip; element cache: red/orange=actual repaint · green outline=View cache hit · yellow=bounds cache miss · red outline=dirty/forced refresh/reuse failure · purple outline=other cache key or retained-range miss · cyan=progressive reuse
